  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Heat a large saucepan over high heat with a pinch of salt. Add boiling water to saucepan. • Cook fusilli in the boiling water until ‘al dente’, 11 minutes. Reserve some pasta water(see ingredients). • Drain and return pasta to saucepan.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a45a587f17f4588ed9/step-73ef8d00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, trim ends of asparagus and cut into thirds. Thinly slice leek. Finely chop garlic. • Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook leek and asparagus, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes. Add a dash of water to pan to help asparagus cook.• Add garlic and garlic &amp; herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a45a587f17f4588ed9/step-947d2e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Reduce heat to medium, then add light cooking cream, stock concentrate and the reserved pasta water, simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. • Add basil pesto, cooked fusilli and baby spinach leaves. Stir to combine and season to taste with salt and pepper. TIP: Add a splash more pasta water if the sauce looks too thick. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a45a587f17f4588ed9/step-f03f4920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide creamy asparagus and leek fusilli between bowls.• Sprinkle over Parmesan to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling over the Parmesan!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6a45a587f17f4588ed9/step-6a639e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
